Since my Amiga multitasks to nicely, I start an editor when I start up
NetHack.  I keep a list of everything interesting you can't get by
typing "\".  This includes a genocide list, list of levels with
altars and vaults, levels with leprechauns and nymphs, and so forth.

Seems to work well, especially if I have several games in a short
amount of time.

